  "worked_solution": "The number is *positive* because it is to the *right* of zero.\n\nThe absolute value of the number is $5,$ so the distance between that number and zero on a number line is $5.$ \n\nThe positive number at a distance of $5$ from zero is $5$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14145654/assets/7e1e41b708d66f3b3abc1e58dd49afa96d958b64d6575bcdf7f6d26168bd13ba.png)",
